  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray",
    "1.5 cups water",
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "1 (6 ounce) package quick-cooking stuffing mix (such as Stove Top®), or more to taste",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "1 medium onion, diced",
    "3 stalks celery, diced, or more to taste",
    "1 (10.5 ounce) can low-sodium cream of chicken soup",
    "0.5 (10.5 ounce) can low-sodium cream of mushroom soup",
    "1 (8 ounce) container sour cream",
    "1 whole cooked rotisserie chicken - skinned, boned, and meat shredded",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Spray a 9x13-inch baking dish with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HnFbx7f5LP-jJjZf0r21CmnFEg0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240220-RotisserieChickenStuffingCasserole-mfs-step1-0508-a56f50346a744835bed4ae140ce6e3ed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240220/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring water and 1/4 cup butter to a boil in a saucepan over medium heat. Add stuffing mix and stir to combine. Remove the saucepan from the heat, cover, and let sit until water is absorbed, about 5 minutes. Fluff stuffing with a fork.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HcTZ_HRtUMHIPSN-vQ_0EVUg0P0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240220-RotisserieChickenStuffingCasserole-mfs-step3-0522-797500cfa7664135a47f6714251c02d0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240220/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While you are preparing stuffing, melt 1 tablespoon butter in a skillet over medium heat. Add onion and celery; cook and stir until softened, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Q_CHwT9bu46O7Lh6WKNkeWc8mg4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240220-RotisserieChickenStuffingCasserole-mfs-step4-0516-80ef02fbd7dc4b089da642ceaca5e405.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240220/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix both condensed soups with sour cream in a bowl until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WtRq2faqXEinXgct6vQhqycfEZ0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240220-RotisserieChickenStuffingCasserole-mfs-step5-0517-cb39446d4cb447b6ae7eddc4c4a6cc0a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240220/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread shredded chicken in the bottom of the prepared baking dish. Layer onion mixture over chicken and season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4gQV4vgvaDUfy8Qw2ZL4yx5gMcs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240220-RotisserieChickenStuffingCasserole-mfs-step7-0524-78ea6cf99f5a406e846ebb326da9d794.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240220/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with soup mixture and spread stuffing evenly over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yRQlnFuPdfk_uIrmxh8-30pfTnw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240220-RotisserieChickenStuffingCasserole-mfs-step9-0527-4799fa48731c41e6a0b4f15fcaa4cdac.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240220/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until filling is bubbly and topping is golden brown, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uSYnXcniE55LhtGdl_igQy9uUvs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240220-RotisserieChickenStuffingCasserole-mfs-step10-0546-3ff900d77b4440698928441f8c118f6e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240220/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Q9SNP6QwJrMjL0pNaZmuicjK9H4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240220-rotisserie-chicken-and-stuffing-casserole-DDMFS-4x3-01fcb5d23fb64d9db8afd970741be78d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240220/step_08.webp"
    }
